---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Aaron Holmes | Resume"
  description="Resume for Aaron Holmes, technical implementation and business systems professional."
>
  <main class="resume-page">
    <nav class="resume-actions" aria-label="Resume actions">
      <a href="/">← Back to portfolio</a>
      <button id="print-resume" type="button">Print or save as PDF</button>
    </nav>

    <article class="resume-paper">
      <header class="resume-header">
        <h1>Aaron Holmes</h1>
        <p class="resume-position">Technical Implementation | Business Systems and Integrations</p>
        <p class="resume-contact">
          Michigan (Remote) · 734-489-9849 · <a href="mailto:aaronholmesdev@gmail.com">aaronholmesdev@gmail.com</a> ·
          <a href="https://aaronholmes.dev">aaronholmes.dev</a> ·
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aaronholmesdev/">LinkedIn</a>
        </p>
      </header>

      <section>
        <h2>Profile</h2>
        <p>Technical implementation and business systems professional who connects operational needs to reliable software, APIs, automations, and customer-facing solutions. Experienced in SaaS onboarding, production troubleshooting, CRM architecture, scripting, and project delivery across healthcare, financial services, and restaurant operations. Combines hands-on technical execution with customer discovery, product judgment, and years of operational leadership.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Core Skills</h2>
        <p>Technical Implementation · Systems Integration · SaaS Onboarding and Customer Support · REST APIs and Webhooks · CRM and Workflow Architecture · Requirements Discovery · Business Process Mapping · Data Quality and Reconciliation · Root-Cause Analysis · Product Feedback · Project and Vendor Coordination · Documentation and Training</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Professional Experience</h2>
        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>TixWork <span>— SaaS Implementation, Product and Customer Support</span></h3><p>Current · Via Ascend</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Support onboarding, troubleshooting, maintenance, and customer communications for an operations SaaS platform used across 100+ restaurant locations.</li>
            <li>Serve as the team’s restaurant-operations subject-matter expert in customer demos, sales conversations, and product discussions; bridge real-world operating needs and technical decisions.</li>
            <li>Use hands-on customer feedback and operational experience to shape features, workflows, usability improvements, and product priorities.</li>
            <li>Contribute to the revised customer-acquisition and marketing approach while supporting existing operators and coordinating technical follow-up.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>Lincoln Health Supply <span>— Business Systems Automation Engineer</span></h3><p>Sep 2025 – Aug 2026</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Took primary hands-on technical responsibility for a largely undocumented healthcare automation environment spanning 400+ Zoho CRM workflows, approximately 150 existing Deluge functions, approximately 15 Zoho Flows, and hundreds of Zapier automations.</li>
            <li>Built a custom multi-endpoint pVerify REST integration with bearer-token authentication, request and response logic, patient and payer normalization, CRM mappings, and production troubleshooting.</li>
            <li>Rebuilt fragmented duplicate processing around normalized patient data, product and stage rules, ownership and supplier routing, and a 30-day window; reviewed and corrected issues across approximately 300 recent records.</li>
            <li>Mapped distinct intake paths across three locations and implemented compression-garment workflows joining Zoho Survey, Sheets, CRM, product logic, documentation, and order processing.</li>
            <li>Traced failures across intake, insurance, prescriptions, fax and SMS, and fulfillment; improved logging and support procedures, evaluated high-volume Zapier tasks, and trained another employee.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>AviKaiDo <span>— Business Systems and Automation Consultant</span></h3><p>Nov 2019 – Present · Projects</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Built websites, data-driven automations, integrations, and client workflows across healthcare, financial services, publishing, and small businesses; handled discovery through troubleshooting.</li>
            <li>Created securities-backed lending sites and automations for High West Capital Partners, Global Stock Lenders, and International Liquidity Partners, using borrower and ticker data, market history, LTV rules, and deal documents.</li>
            <li>Developed Ask Your Primary’s pharmacy QR intake and CRM/fax integration prototype and TheRedZone’s automated content-ingestion and classification workflows.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-role">
          <div class="resume-role-header"><h3>Ascend Internet Marketing <span>— Web Development, CRM and Client Delivery</span></h3><p>Nov 2015 – Present · Projects</p></div>
          <ul>
            <li>Delivered website and CRM-related projects for clients including Schafer Development and Cure Launcher, spanning buildout, support, troubleshooting, and client communication.</li>
            <li>Worked on JK&amp;T Wings’ custom maintenance-tracking system, the original client solution that later evolved into the TixWork SaaS product.</li>
            <li>Coordinated requirements, developers and vendors, issue resolution, digital project milestones, and ongoing client support across multiple accounts.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Technology</h2>
        <p><strong>Integrations and platforms:</strong> Zoho CRM and Zoho One, Zoho Flow, Zapier, Deluge, REST APIs, Webhooks, JSON, API Authentication, pVerify, PandaDoc, Phaxio, Telnyx, Sinch, Google Workspace, WordPress</p>
        <p><strong>Programming and cloud:</strong> Python, JavaScript, TypeScript, SQL, Node.js, Git and GitHub, AWS (EC2, S3, RDS, IAM, VPC and Networking), Linux and WSL, Playwright, BeautifulSoup, Astro, OpenAI API</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.querySelector("#print-resume")?.addEventListener("click", () => window.print());
</script>

<style>
  .resume-page {
    width: min(100% - 2rem, 960px);
    margin: 2rem auto 5rem;
  }
  .resume-actions {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }
  .resume-actions button {
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 0.45rem;
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .resume-paper {
    padding: 2.2rem 2.5rem;
    color: #1a2630;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e0e5ea;
    box-shadow: 0 7px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.09);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .resume-header {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .resume-header h1 {
    max-width: unset;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .resume-position {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.015em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .resume-contact {
    margin: 0.28rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.79rem;
  }
  .resume-paper a { color: #244f73; }
  .resume-paper section { margin-top: 0.85rem; }
  .resume-paper section > h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
    padding-bottom: 0.18rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #244f73;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
    letter-spacing: 0.045em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #244f73;
  }
  .resume-paper section p { margin: 0.25rem 0 0.4rem; }
  .resume-role { margin-top: 0.55rem; break-inside: avoid; }
  .resume-role-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .resume-role-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .resume-role-header h3 span { font-weight: 500; }
  .resume-role-header p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.76rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .resume-paper ul {
    padding-left: 1rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }
  .resume-paper li { padding-left: 0.08rem; margin: 0 0 0.18rem; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .resume-paper { padding: 1.3rem; }
    .resume-role-header { display: block; }
    .resume-role-header p { margin-top: 0.15rem; }
  }
  @page { size: letter; margin: 0.45in; }
  @media print {
    :global(.site-header) { display: none !important; }
    :global(body) { margin: 0; background: white !important; }
    .resume-page { width: auto; margin: 0; }
    .resume-actions { display: none; }
    .resume-paper {
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      box-shadow: none;
      font-size: 9pt;
      line-height: 1.22;
    }
    .resume-header h1 { font-size: 17pt; }
    .resume-paper section { margin-top: 0.46rem; }
    .resume-role { margin-top: 0.3rem; }
    .resume-paper li { margin-bottom: 0.1rem; }
    .resume-paper section > h2 { font-size: 9.2pt; }
    .resume-role-header h3 { font-size: 9.2pt; }
    .resume-contact { font-size: 8.2pt; }
    a { text-decoration: none; }
  }
</style>